SUMMARY: URGENT PUBLIC SERVICE ANNOUNCEMENT from HesFree’s Texas Virtual 
 Charter High School\, a Full-time Virtual Campus for students aged 18 to 
 50\, throughout the state of Texas
DESCRIPTION:Hello everyone\, I thank you for taking the time out of your 
 busy schedule to read this post. I pray that each of you is having and wi
 ll continue to have a Blessed day.\n\nThe following public service announ
 cement is being posted to inform everyone that HesFree’s Texas Virtual Ch
 arter High School is a Full-time Virtual Campus and will begin registrati
 on on September 11\, 2025\, for adult learners aged 18 to 50\, throughout
  the state of Texas\, to earn their high school diploma. I am posting thi
 s message for adult learners aged 18 to 50 who want to earn their FREE T.
 E.A.-approved high school diplomas from the state of Texas. Therefore\, t
 o become a student at our full-time virtual campus\, please click on the 
 following link:\n\nwww.hesfreestexasvirtualcharterhighschoolages18to50.co
 m/. https://www.hesfreestexasvirtualcharterhighschoolages18to50.com/. Thi
 s link will direct you to HesFree’s Texas Virtual Charter High School\, a
  Full-time Virtual Campus’s website. Once you are on our website\, please
  use the contact information to provide your full name (as it appears on 
 your high school transcript)\, an email address\, and other pertinent det
 ails stating why you would like to receive your high school diploma. We r
 eturn calls and emails within two to three business days. TEA-approved fr
 om the state of Texas.\n\nThis Public Service Announcement is brought to 
 you by HesFree's Texas Virtual Charter High School\, a Full-time Virtual 
 Campus. In accordance with SB 569\, SB 2032\, and HB 4\, students aged 18
  to 50 will be able to earn dual credits while attending HesFree’s Texas 
 Virtual Charter High School\, a Full-time Virtual Campus and Blinn Colleg
 e (i.e.\, students will need to qualify to receive FREE tuition from the 
 State of Texas or receive scholarship(s) from HesFree's Texas Virtual Cha
 rter High School to attend Blinn College\, further details will be presen
 ted after admission to HesFree's Texas Virtual Charter High School). Blin
 n College and HesFree's Texas Virtual Charter High School have formed a p
 artnership that allows students aged 18 to 50 to attend both entities\, e
 arning dual credits while pursuing their high school diploma
CATEGORIES:
