SUMMARY: Brazos County 4-H Club Fair
DESCRIPTION:Join us Saturday\, August 15th at the Brazos County Club Fair
 \; a come and go event from 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM at the Brazos County Exte
 nsion Office (4153 County Park Ct.\, Bryan).\n\nBrazos County 4-H is a yo
 uth development program that empowers young people to discover their pass
 ions\, develop leadership and life skills\, and gain hands-on experiences
  through projects\, service\, and competition. Whether your interests are
  in livestock\, robotics\, photography\, cooking\, public speaking\, shoo
 ting sports\, or countless other areas\, there's a place for you in 4-H!\
 n\nBrazos County 4-H offers nearly 20 clubs for you to call home. Come vi
 sit with current 4-H members to find the best fit for YOU! 4-H Clubs are 
 often focused around a community or geographical area\, but some speciali
 ze in specific projects. So\, we also encourage you to explore the more t
 han 40 project opportunities supported by Texas 4-H! We are so excited fo
 r you to join our program\, see you Saturday\, August 15th!
CATEGORIES:youth,agriculture,stem,4h
