SUMMARY: Sisterhood Social
DESCRIPTION:A fun\, laid-back hangout where women connect\, share laughs\
 , and build awesome friendships in person!\n\nJoin Us at the Sisterhood S
 ocial!\nSisterhood Social - A Night Created Just for Women by Women!\n\nG
 rab your girlfriends and join us for an unforgettable evening of shopping
 \, sipping\, relaxing\, and celebrating all things women!\n\nHosted by Ba
 ckPorch Antiques & Boutique\, the Sisterhood Social will feature:\n\n20+ 
 varieties of wines or cocktails\n20+ women owned and women focused busine
 sses showcasing their products and services\n20+ door prizes\, giveaways\
 , and specialty drawings throughout the evening\n\nLive Music by Cathey B
 olin\nComplimentary chair Massages by Beverly Dizzine\nBotox Bar on site\
 nPlus much more activities designed to help women relax\, recharge\, and 
 enjoy a well-deserved night out.\n\nThis event is dedicated to giving wom
 en a chance to step away from the demands of everyday life\, connect with
  friends\, support local businesses\, and focus on self care in a fun and
  welcoming atmosphere.\n\nEven better\, a portion of the events proceeds 
 will be donated to a local non profit organization\, allowing us to give 
 back while bringing our community together.\n\nThe Sisterhood Social is p
 lanned as a semi-annual event\, making it a signature tradition you won't
  want to miss.\n\nGather your friends\, enjoy a night of laughter and rel
 axation\, and celebrate the power of women supporting women. We can't wai
 t to see you there!
CATEGORIES:womens-event,sip-and-shop,live-music,artist
