  at Woodway United Methodist Church\,\n\n21000 Woodway Drive. Rehearsal w
 ill begin at 9:30 am.\n\nThe semester registration fee is $75. Membership
  in the\n\nSinging Seniors is open to all senior adults 55 and above.\n\n
 No musical training or audition is required. Anyone with\n\na love of sin
 ging is welcome to join our Baylor Choir Family.\n\nCall 210-997-5370 or 
 830-660-3253
