SUMMARY: Closing the Gap of Mental and Medical Care
DESCRIPTION:Closing the Gap of Mental and Medical Care\n\nChildren naviga
 ting medical care face challenges that extend beyond diagnosis and treatm
 ent. This one-hour session explores the integration of medical and mental
  health care. By the end of this session\, participants will be able to: 
 (1) recognize the importance of supporting social developmental throughou
 t a child's medical treatment\; (2) identify opportunities to address dev
 elopmental needs both inside and outside the medical care environment\; a
 nd (3) integrate age-specific medical competencies with social developmen
 tal principles. This session is intended for medical professionals who wo
 rk with children or parents of children who are navigating medical care. 
 While it is hosted by ACPA\, the principles are not limited to this popul
 ation.\n\nTo register: acpacares.org/discussion-forums/ https://acpacares
 .org/discussion-forums/
CATEGORIES:Medical-Care,Children's-Health,Mental-Health,cleft-lip-and-pal
 ate
