SUMMARY: 35mm
DESCRIPTION:A picture is worth 1\,000 words — what about a song? Can a pi
 cture inspire a song or fifteen? In 35mm\, each photo creates an unique s
 ong\, moments frozen in time\; a glimmer of a life unfolding\, a glimpse 
 of something happening. A stunning new multimedia musical which explores 
 a groundbreaking new concept in musical theatre... This intricately woven
  collection of stories told through song reimagines what the modern Ameri
 can musical can be.
