SUMMARY: How to Succeed in Business Without Really Trying
DESCRIPTION:A satire of big business and all it holds sacred\, How to Suc
 ceed in Business without Really Trying follows the rise of J. Pierrepont 
 Finch\, who uses a little handbook called How to Succeed in Business with
 out Really Trying to climb the corporate ladder from lowly window washer 
 to high-powered executive\, tackling such familiar but potent dangers as 
 the aggressively compliant "company man\," the office party\, backstabbin
 g coworkers\, caffeine addiction and\, of course\, true love.
