SUMMARY: Ricky Nelson Remembered Starring Matthew and Gunnar Nelson
DESCRIPTION:The season opens with an interactive\, multimedia rock ’n’ ro
 ll concert experience celebrating the groundbreaking career of Rock and R
 oll Hall of Famer Ricky Nelson.\n\nRising to fame on the television serie
 s “The Adventures of Ozzie & Harriet\,” Ricky Nelson became one of Americ
 a’s first teen idols and one of the most influential rock artists of his 
 generation. He sold more than 140 million recordings and helped define th
 e sound and style of early rock ’n’ roll.\n\nHis legacy lives on through 
 his twin sons\, Matthew and Gunnar Nelson\, multiplatinum recording artis
 ts who honor their father’s music through live performance\, personal sto
 ries\, archival footage\, and family memories.\n\nThe performance feature
 s Ricky Nelson classics such as “Poor Little Fool\,” “Hello Mary Lou\,” “
 Travelin’ Man\,” “I’m Walking\,” and “Garden Party\,” as well as Matthew 
 and Gunnar’s chart-topping songs “Love and Affection” and “After the Rain
 .”\n\nAs seventh-generation entertainers\, Matthew and Gunnar bring authe
 nticity and a deeply personal perspective to a timeless collection of son
 gs that continues to resonate across generations.\n\nTickets are availabl
 e at www.blinn.edu/boxoffice https://nam04.safelinks.protection.outlook.c
 om/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.blinn.edu%2Fboxoffice&data=05%7C02%7Crichard.bra
 y%40blinn.edu%7C52cebcd0e5ce438884e608def6eaf844%7C60448a85d0074d57a583bf
 ec98e99c29%7C1%7C0%7C639219686257480628%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0e
 U1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIj
 oyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=N9%2FJzjWKUosC2puJ2Z6MlsAj7h6SV%2FJw6%2F%2F
 5%2FryjsqE%3D&reserved=0 or by calling 979-830-4024.
CATEGORIES:music,live-music,performing-arts
