 celebration of community\, local businesses\, and all things fall! Enjoy 
 a local vendor market\, live music from Dallas Shippe\, a BBQ competition
 \, and family-friendly activities for all ages.\n\nShop unique handmade g
 oods\, boutique items\, home décor\, baked goods\, artwork\, and more whi
 le supporting local makers\, artisans\, and entrepreneurs from across the
  Brazos Valley. Families can also enjoy interactive activities\, crafts\,
  games\, and other hands-on fall fun.\n\nWhether you're looking to shop l
