SUMMARY: Texas A&M College of Architecture Annual Showcase
DESCRIPTION:The Texas A&M College of Architecture 4th Annual Showcase con
 nects students\, faculty\, industry leaders and members of the community 
 in College Station with the exchange of ideas and research.\n\nBuilding o
 n the foundation of past events\, the 2026 Showcase explores the critical
  role of professional judgment in an increasingly automated world. While 
 we embrace artificial intelligence and robotics\, we celebrate the crafts
 men\, designers\, and planners who decide how to move our communities for
