SUMMARY: Grand Reopening Weekend - Brazos Valley Museum of Natural Histor
 y
DESCRIPTION:Grand Reopening Weekend - Brazos Valley Museum of Natural His
 tory\n\n\nJoin us for an exciting Grand Reopening Weekend celebrating our
  newly renovated facility!\n\n\nSATURDAY\, NOVEMBER 21\, 2026:\n\n- 10:00
  AM: Ribbon Cutting Ceremony\n\n- 11:00 AM: New Dinosaur Exhibit Gallery 
 Tour\n\n- 1:00 PM - 4:00 PM: Children's Fossil Dig\n\n- 7:00 PM: Planetar
 ium Show "Stars Over the Brazos Valley"\n\n\nSUNDAY\, NOVEMBER 22\, 2026:
 \n\n- 10:00 AM - 5:00 PM: Family Day (all-day activities and exhibits)\n\
 n\nAll times are CDT.\n\n\nADMISSION:\n\n- Adults: $12\n\n- Children: $8\
 n\n- Under 3: FREE\n\n\nCome explore our brand-new dinosaur exhibit galle
 ry\, enjoy hands-on activities for kids\, and experience our stunning pla
 netarium show. This is a weekend the whole family will enjoy!
