SUMMARY: Uptown: A Celebration of Motown and Soul
DESCRIPTION:With the style of the Temptations\, the moves of the Jackson 
 5\, and the energy of Bruno Mars\, Uptown brings a fresh\, contemporary a
 pproach to classic Motown\, soul\, and rhythm and blues.\n\nUptown combin
 es world-class vocals\, dynamic choreography\, and charismatic stage pres
 ence in a high-energy production designed to get audiences on their feet.
  Each member is an accomplished soloist\, but together they create rich h
 armonies and a vibrant\, modern sound.\n\nThe group’s repertoire blends c
 ontemporary radio hits with music made famous by artists such as Stevie W
 onder\, Marvin Gaye\, the Temptations\, the Jackson 5\, and Earth\, Wind 
 & Fire.\n\n“Uptown is fabulous — great music\, totally engaging\, highly 
 professional\, and thoroughly entertaining\,” said Cissy Segall Davis\, m
 anaging director of Miller Outdoor Theatre in Houston. “Serious thumbs-up
  recommendation!”\n\nThe performance will include favorites such as Bruno
  Mars’ “Uptown Funk\,” Stevie Wonder’s “Superstition\,” Earth\, Wind & Fi
 re’s “September\,” and Marvin Gaye’s “What’s Going On.”\n\nTickets are av
 ailable at www.blinn.edu/boxoffice https://nam04.safelinks.protection.out
 look.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.blinn.edu%2Fboxoffice&data=05%7C02%7Cricha
 rd.bray%40blinn.edu%7C52cebcd0e5ce438884e608def6eaf844%7C60448a85d0074d57
 a583bfec98e99c29%7C1%7C0%7C639219686257480628%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJ
 FbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIs
 IldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&sdata=N9%2FJzjWKUosC2puJ2Z6MlsAj7h6SV%2FJw6
 %2F%2F5%2FryjsqE%3D&reserved=0 or by calling 979-830-4024.
CATEGORIES:music,live-music,performing-arts
